demption&amp;#x27; = capture the business customer&amp;#x27;s VAT # at sale, issue a B2B tax invoice, and report the VAT they can reclaim.&lt;br&gt;Currency: screenshots show 3-decimal prices (0.855, 1.522) and VAT 5%. The code stores whole minor units (x100) and formats INR only, so a 3-decimal currency needs a per-currency decimals setting." style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D0D3D4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1040" width="2720" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>